{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋個別握手会に来てくれた皆さん、ありがとうございました((o(´∀｀)o))\n楽しかったぁ〜〜〜〜〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週皆さんとお話できて、たくさんパワー吸収できました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の私服はコレ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/7463034/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白のワンピース♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ、靴下がまがってる(´Д`；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は1、2部はポニーテール、3部お団子、4部ハーフアップ、5部ポニーテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上の写真はポニーテールです(oﾟ▽ﾟ)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部で初めてやったハーフアップが意外にも好評で、ななみんに「推し髪！」って言われて高まったー( ´////_ゝ///｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/7463034/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！Bicycleの握手会は残りあと二回！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張での全国握手会と、横浜での個別握手会o(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来れる方は是非、来てくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてるよ〜(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと告知！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜19時〜放送 フジテレビ\n「爆笑!大日本アカン警察」に生田、松村、白石の三人がVTRで出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この三人の共通点と言えば...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非みてください(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text"